sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Member in Slack
  participant S as Slack adapter
  participant R as Commands
  participant MS as Message settings
  participant A as Analytics
  U->>S: presses Stop Monday quests
  S->>S: slackInteractivity: verify, parse action_id
  S->>R: receiveHomeClick then runCommand(stopMondayQuests)
  R->>R: questsFor(member).path is monday, else no-op
  R->>MS: setMessageSetting(quests, none)
  R->>A: message setting changed{kind: quests, via: dm-button}
  S->>U: chat.update says stopped, with Turn back on
  U->>S: clicks a DM link button (URL)
  S->>A: dm link clicked{kind, destination}
  Note over U,A: Slack opens the URL itself, and the website visit, item turned and quests viewed join by person in PostHog
